repository-code: "https://github.com/itsashiish/chunaviq"
url: "https://chunaviq.oglic.com"
abstract: >-
  Research prototype of an end-to-end verifiable, secret-ballot online election adapted to Indian law,
  identity infrastructure and scale: deniable revoting with a polling-day override, Aadhaar-or-PAN
  registration, one national threshold key held in hardware security modules, verifiable shuffles,
  two independent verifiers, a national-scale capacity model and open adversarial dress rehearsals.
  Synthetic data only; not for binding elections.
keywords:
  - electronic voting
  - end-to-end verifiability
  - coercion resistance
  - revoting
  - verifiable shuffle
  - threshold cryptography
  - hardware security modules
  - India
